# tip-a (plan section 6, M7): the pointer resting on a's number box (its centre (383, 424) at
# 1440 x 900): row a lit at once, and 400 ms later (NumberBox.tsx REST_MS) the tip under the row,
# its right edge at the box's: the box's gestures in words.
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
wait 2000
move 383 424
wait 500
shot tip-a
